| two distinct | 3 | 2 | 2 | 0 | 0 |
| collinear duplicates | 6 | 5 | 2 | 6 | 10 |
| subnormal triangle | 3 | 3 | 3 | 3 | 9 |
| subnormal line | 4 | 4 | 2 | 4 | 8 |
